    !>     \brief  BLAS Level 1 API
    !>
    !>     \details
    !>     The scal_batched functions scale each element of vector ``x_i`` with scalar ``alpha``,
    !>     for ``i`` = 1, ... , ``batch_count``:
    !>
    !>         x_i := alpha * x_i,
    !>
    !>     where (``x_i``) is the i-th instance of the batch.
