    !>     ``alpha`` and ``beta`` are scalars, ``x_i`` and ``y_i`` are vectors, and ``A_i`` is an
    !>     ``n`` by ``n`` symmetric matrix, for ``i`` = 1, ..., ``batch_count``.
    !>     ``A`` should contain an upper or lower triangular ``n`` by ``n`` packed symmetric matrix.
    !>
