  !>     \brief  BLAS Level 2 API
  !>
  !>     \details
  !>     The tbmv_strided_batched functions perform one of the matrix-vector operations:
  !>
  !>         x_i := A_i*x_i      or
  !>         x_i := A_i**T*x_i   or
  !>         x_i := A_i**H*x_i,
  !>
  !>     where (``A_i``, ``x_i``) is the i-th instance of the batch,
  !>     ``x_i`` is a vector, and ``A_i`` is an ``n`` by ``n`` matrix, for ``i`` = 1, ...,
  !>     ``batch_count``.
  !>
