  !>          A*x = b or
  !>          A**T*x = b or
  !>          A**H*x = b
  !>
  !>     where ``x`` and ``b`` are vectors and ``A`` is a triangular matrix stored in the packed
  !>     format.
  !>
  !>     The input vector ``b`` is overwritten by the output vector ``x``.
