  !>     \brief  BLAS Level 2 API
  !>
  !>     \details
  !>     The spr functions perform the matrix-vector operations:
  !>
  !>         A := A + alpha*x*x**T
  !>
  !>     where ``alpha`` is a scalar, ``x`` is a vector, and ``A`` is an
  !>     ``n`` by ``n`` symmetric matrix, supplied in packed form.
  !>
