  !>
  !>     @param[in] alpha
  !>             alpha specifies the scalar alpha. When alpha is
  !>             zero, A is not referenced and A need not be set before
  !>             entry.
  !>
  !>     @param[in] A - pointer storing matrix A on the GPU.
