  !>     ``alpha`` and ``beta`` are scalars, and ``A``, ``B`` and ``C`` are matrices, with
  !>     ``op( A )`` an ``m`` by ``k`` matrix, ``op( B )`` a ``k`` by ``n`` matrix, and ``C`` an
  !>     ``m`` by ``n`` matrix.
